### Files Changed

1. **`app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml`**
   - Changed 3 filter string values to sentence case / "Moderate" per owner decision 7:
     - `high_risk_filter`: `"High Risk"` &rarr; `"High risk"`
     - `medium_risk_filter`: `"Medium Risk"` &rarr; `"Moderate risk"`
     - `low_risk_filter`: `"Low Risk"` &rarr; `"Low risk"`
   - Appended 3 strings to the bottom (before `</resources>`):
     - `no_matching_patients`: `"No matching patients found"`
     - `no_patients_in_category`: `"No patients in this category"`
     - `case_id_line`: `"Case: %1$s"`

2. **`app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/PatientListScreen.kt`**
   - Level 3 safety preserved: `PatientDashboardRowProjection`, `projectDashboardRow`, `dashboardPatients`, `visiblePatients`, `riskFilter` logic, counts, sort order, and events are completely untouched.
   - Restyled title row: primary-colored `RecordType.HeaderName` with heading semantics, subtitle count in `RecordType.Secondary` onSurfaceVariant, and 48dp `RecordShapes.Small` filled "New patient" `Button` (no icon).
   - Restyled notice: `OutlinedCard` with `RecordShapes.Large`, `RecordType.Secondary` text in onSurface.
   - Restyled search: `OutlinedTextField` with `RecordShapes.Small` (10dp) and `Modifier.minimumTouchTarget()` on clear icon.
   - Filter chips: unified `ListFilterChip` helper using `RecordShapes.Small`, 48dp interactive touch target, filled primary/onPrimary when selected, outline border.
   - Sort button: 48dp `TextButton` with `RecordShapes.Small`, `RecordType.Action` typography, and 16dp down arrow.
   - Empty state: `OutlinedCard` with `RecordShapes.Large`, `RecordType.FieldValue` centered text referencing `no_matching_patients` / `no_patients_in_category`.
   - List spacing updated to `Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp)`.
   - Added `private val RecordType.HeaderName` (22 sp / 28 sp, Bold) locally so `RecordTokens.kt` was not modified outside the slice 5 Files table.

3. **`app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patientdirectory/PatientActionsModalSheet.kt`**
   - Restyled header: `RecordType.SectionTitle` onSurface title, `listOfNotNull(stringResource(R.string.case_id_line, patient.caseId), patient.ageText?.takeIf { it.isNotBlank() }).joinToString(", ")` in `RecordType.Secondary` (eliminates trailing separator when age is missing), and close `IconButton` with `Modifier.minimumTouchTarget()` and string resource `close`.
   - Removed `HorizontalDivider`.
   - Replaced custom rows with `SheetActionRow` (`Surface(onClick = ...)` with `RecordShapes.Small` (10dp) and min height 56dp):
     - Record visit: primary styling (`FieldFamilies.patient().container` and primary text)
     - Open workspace: neutral `surfaceContainerHigh`
     - Edit patient: neutral `surfaceContainerHigh`
     - Archive / Unarchive: neutral `surfaceContainerHigh` with error text when active (`danger = !isArchived`), keeping existing subtitle
     - Removed all row icons and trailing "›" chevrons
   - Cancel button: `TextButton` with `RecordShapes.Small`, `RecordType.Action` style, min height 48dp.

---

### Anything Not Done

- **None**: All changes specified in `docs/designs/redesign/slice_05_list_chrome.md` were implemented exactly as specified. New tests were left for the testing lane per the spec.
